====== Xiaomi Redmi AX6000 ======


The Xiaomi Redmi AX6000 router supports 4 802.11ax streams on both 2.4GHz @40MHz and 5GHz @160MHz for a combined 6000Mbps wireless speed. It is based on the MediaTek MT7986A SoC.


{{media:xiaomi:redmi-ax6000.png|Redmi AX6000}}

